 {e}^{4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}-z-3} & =c \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}-z-3 & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡c \\\\ z & =4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡c,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $c>0.$\n\nTherefore, we get a family of elliptic paraboloids:\n\n$$\nz=4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡c,\\,c\\in (0,\\infty )\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/state.json" "file_sha256" "d84c2251596b91cc10e0a031c222de37aff3a7e15241c70f709bc0c7cbfedc21" "basis" 2289 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129199" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "25202b02c58253dd349657c72e1ea1dd909de088ce40ffba57ffc6d14b895a6b" "basis" 2289 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129199" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/state.json" "file_sha256" "d84c2251596b91cc10e0a031c222de37aff3a7e15241c70f709bc0c7cbfedc21" "basis" 2289 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068037/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129199" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "A family of elliptic paraboloids: $z=-4{x}^{2}-9{y}^{2}+3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡c$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-c